Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:04.43,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}敬啟 致莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.98,0:22:09.98,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}若說起我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:13.52,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}只不過是平淡乏味的時光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:15.98,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}從改變的那一天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:19.36,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}若說起我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:22.87,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}明明內心是如此沉重
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:26.79,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}身體卻很輕盈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.79,0:22:31.96,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}像是被那芳香吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:35.34,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}這就是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:38.42,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}突然夏風搖動白花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:40.80,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}觸碰到了我空蕩蕩的心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:44.97,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}你用那雙瞳找到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.48,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}敬啟 致我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:52.98,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}始終背負的疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:56.48,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}是否在慢慢消散
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.86,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}大抵很美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:02.28,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}你讓我看到的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:06.28,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}至今仍在仍在綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.70,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}連倒影都看不見的深海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:11.04,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}若是能將不知方向的告別
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:14.88,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}也一起接納的話 什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:18.05,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}這樣的念頭浮現在心頭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:22.34,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}但你還在繼續呼吸著
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:25.05,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\fad(180,300)}不是今日的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:28.22,ED_CN3,,0,0,0,,{=41}{\blur8\fad(180,300)}送給那一天的我 莉莉
